repository-code: https://github.com/IIAS-Research/DrIA
abstract: >-
  DrIA helps physicians create AI models from their data. Its guided workflow
  lets users upload a CSV file, explore the data, train models, understand the
  results and try predictions. Computation is handled by the IAML web service.
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - artificial intelligence
  - medical research
  - data exploration
  - model interpretability
